PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "{PLAYER}?\p"
    .string "You made it.\p"
    .string "...Good. I was really hoping you\n"
    .string "would.\p"
    .string "I couldn't tell you what I was\n"
    .string "doing. {RIVAL} couldn't either.\p"
    .string "You've been helping me build this\n"
    .string "team almost the whole way here,\l"
    .string "whether you knew it or not.\p"
    .string "Every time you found a weakness,\n"
    .string "I fixed it. Every time you\l"
    .string "surprised me, I learned something.\p"
    .string "Eventually I stopped looking for\n"
    .string "different POKéMON. I had the\l"
    .string "right six.\p"
    .string "I just needed to get better at\n"
    .string "using them.\p"
    .string "And I got here first.\p"
    .string "So if you want to be Champion...\n"
    .string "you have to beat the team you\l"
    .string "helped me build.\p"
    .string "No more tests, {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "This one counts.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RepeatIntro::
    .string "Back again. Good.\p"
    .string "Neither of us needs another\n"
    .string "speech.\p"
    .string "Show me what you changed.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "There you are.\p"
    .string "I was hoping you'd make another\n"
    .string "run through the LEAGUE.\p"
    .string "You're still the Champion.\n"
    .string "I haven't forgotten.\p"
    .string "But I've had a lot of time to\n"
    .string "think about our last battle.\p"
    .string "And now that I finally caught you\n"
    .string "here...\p"
    .string "I want another shot at the title.\p"
    .string "Champion versus challenger.\p"
    .string "Ready, {PLAYER}?$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_SubsequentRematchIntro::
    .string "Back again? Good.\p"
    .string "You know what I want.\p"
    .string "Put the title on the line.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "...You did it.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Victory::
    .string "That's it.\n"
    .string "That's the team I wanted.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "I kept trying to build a team\n"
    .string "with no weak points.\p"
    .string "But there's always another\n"
    .string "decision. Another switch.\l"
    .string "Another move you could have made\n"
    .string "instead.\p"
    .string "Today, you made the better ones.\p"
    .string "And after everything we've thrown\n"
    .string "at each other...\p"
    .string "I think this is exactly how it\n"
    .string "should end.\p"
    .string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "You're the Champion.\p"
    .string "Go on. You earned this.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchDefeat::
    .string "Still yours.\p"
    .string "...I'm getting closer, though.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchPostBattle::
    .string "I'll keep working on it.\p"
    .string "Next time you come through here,\n"
    .string "I'm challenging you again.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayer::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "OAK: So, you've won!\n"
    .string "Sincerely, congratulations!\p"
    .string "You're the new POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
    .string "CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "You've grown up so much since you\n"
    .string "first left with {STR_VAR_1} to work\l"
    .string "on the POKéDEX.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, you have come of age!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakImDisappointedRival::
    .string "OAK: {RIVAL}...\n"
    .string "I'm disappointed in you.\p"
    .string "I came when I heard you'd beaten\n"
    .string "the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "But, when I got here, you had\n"
    .string "already lost!\p"
    .string "{RIVAL}, do you understand why\n"
    .string "you lost?\p"
    .string "You have forgotten to treat your\n"
    .string "POKéMON with love and trust.\p"
    .string "Without them, you will never\n"
    .string "become a CHAMP again!$"


PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayerComeWithMe::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "You understand that your victory\n"
    .string "was not just your own doing.\p"
    .string "The bond you share with your\n"
    .string "POKéMON is marvelous.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "Come with me!$"
